'''2x Powder''' is a passive event that can happen in the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} and {{zone|Crystal Hollows}}. 

== Mechanics ==
During the '''2x Powder''' event, all {{Mithril Powder}}, {{Gemstone Powder}} and {{Glacite Powder}} drops are doubled. This includes {{Mithril Powder}} gained from {{NPCSprite|Fetchur}}, the {{NPCSprite|Puzzler}}, [[Commissions]] and the Daily Powder {{Item|Heart of the Mountain}} perk, even though the message still states the original amount of powder.

